{
  "tema": 7052,
  "slug": "deber-deber-de",
  "titulo": "Deber vs deber de (obligation and assumption)",
  "subtitulo": "Debes estudiar / Debe de ser caro.",
  "foto": "t06.jpg",
  "regla": "Deber + infinitive = must (obligation); also accepted for assumptions. Deber de + infinitive = must (assumption, probably), never obligation. For the past: debió de / debe de haber + participle.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": "2026-10-10",
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "Form",
            "Meaning"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "deber + infinitive",
              "obligation: _you must, should_ (also used for assumption in everyday speech)"
            ],
            [
              "deber de + infinitive",
              "assumption only: _must be, probably_"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "So **debe tener 37 años** can be obligation or guess; **debe de tener 37 años** is only a guess."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "It works in other tenses: **debió de llegar a las cuatro** (_it must have arrived at four_)."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "For a guess about the past, also: **debe de haber** + participle (**debe de haber caducado**)."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Pronouns go in front or attached to **haber**, never after the participle: **lo debo de haber dejado** / **debo de haberlo dejado**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: **de** adds doubt: **debe de** = probably."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "suposicion",
      "titulo": "Assumption",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "Esa bolsa ==debe de costar== una fortuna.",
              "en": "That bag must cost a fortune."
            },
            {
              "es": "Las chavas ==deben de llegar== pronto.",
              "en": "The girls should be here soon."
            },
            {
              "es": "Ese cuadro ==debe de ser== de Frida.",
              "en": "That painting must be a Frida."
            },
            {
              "es": "Margarita ==debe de tener== unos 37 años.",
              "en": "Margarita must be about 37."
            },
            {
              "es": "El tren ==debió de llegar== como a las cuatro y media.",
              "en": "The train must have arrived around four thirty."
            },
            {
              "es": "No encuentro mi celular. ==Debo de haberlo dejado== en el carro.",
              "en": "I can't find my phone. I must have left it in the car."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "obligacion",
      "titulo": "Obligation",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "==Debes estudiar== más.",
              "en": "You should study more."
            },
            {
              "es": "No ==debemos llegar== tarde.",
              "en": "We mustn't be late."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
